<body><main class="page" style="max-width:640px"><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT HELP</p><h1>Need help signing in?</h1>{{> messages}}<p>If you created your account with Google, use the same Google account to sign in.</p><a class="button" href="/auth/google">Sign in with Google</a><div class="divider"></div><p class="small muted">For password-based accounts, ask the system administrator for help. Email password-reset delivery has not been configured. This page does not send reset emails.</p><a href="/login">← Back to login</a></section></main></body></html>
